Pi mobile — a Pi Durable client for Android.

The app is a Kotlin/Compose shell around @earendil-works/pi-durable, which runs inside an
application-owned WebView. Files, processes and storage are provided by Kotlin adapters
(AndroidExecutionEnv): the shell is Android's own /system/bin/sh.

No Node.js binary, Linux userland or other prebuilt executables are bundled. The only shipped
JavaScript is the bundle built from `runtime/` (runtime/src -> app/src/main/assets/native-runtime).

